# Windows Overlay Composition

## DirectComposition (WS_EX_NOREDIRECTIONBITMAP)

When `WS_EX_NOREDIRECTIONBITMAP` (0x00400000) is set on the overlay HWND:

- Strip `WS_EX_LAYERED` — never combine layered + no-redirection-bitmap.
- Do not call `SetLayeredWindowAttributes`.
- Re-apply styles in `setup_overlay_window()` after passthrough/edit-mode changes.

Mixing these styles causes DWM to freeze desktop content behind the overlay when entering edit mode.

## Capture

- OBS Window Capture: use "Windows 10 (1903 and up)" (WGC).
- OBS Game Capture: enable "Allow Transparency".
- Legacy BitBlt capture returns black under DirectComposition — expected.
- Keep `WS_EX_APPWINDOW` so OBS can enumerate the window.
